WEBVTT

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:11.144
Love, Just on my love

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:17.484
I want to protect you with these hands

00:00:27.661 --> 00:00:31.765
Do you know real men?

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:35.903
They're weak to the women they protect

00:00:35.903 --> 00:00:40.107
Is he sweeter than me?

00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:44.211
Is he stronger than me?

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:50.984
The night of the full moon is cold

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:53.887
My soul is supposed to be in my hands

00:00:54.788 --> 00:01:03.263
My memories get moved to the shadows

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.334
Love, Just on my love

00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:13.373
I want to protect you with these hands

00:01:13.674 --> 00:01:21.949
You taught me about women, love, and passion

00:01:45.806 --> 00:01:48.208
So this is the Tower of Fangs!

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:54.881
Say, Orphen.

00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:58.585
It's been bothering me for a while.
Why do you wear that pendant?

00:02:00.921 --> 00:02:04.324
After all, isn't that a Tower of Fangs pendant?

00:02:04.324 --> 00:02:07.160
And Orphen, you ran away from there
because you didn't like it.

00:02:10.297 --> 00:02:12.466
This is special.

00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:14.735
Just this, you know?

00:02:23.043 --> 00:02:25.445
Will you come, Krylancelo?

00:02:28.682 --> 00:02:34.688
Back to my hometown,
REMINISCENCE

00:02:43.664 --> 00:02:46.066
Master, the Elders call you.

00:02:46.066 --> 00:02:47.401
The Elders?

00:02:54.341 --> 00:02:56.843
Where in the world was he
and what was he doing?

00:03:00.847 --> 00:03:02.015
Childman?

00:03:02.549 --> 00:03:05.852
That the Tower of Fangs should be attacked!

00:03:05.852 --> 00:03:08.221
This calamity is unheard of in past generations!

00:03:08.221 --> 00:03:10.157
It is your responsibility.

00:03:10.157 --> 00:03:13.927
Because you have hesitated to dispose
of Azalie, we are now in this situation.

00:03:13.927 --> 00:03:17.531
Then inform me as to
the location of Bloody August,

00:03:17.531 --> 00:03:20.701
and I will immediately depart
to meet and obliterate it.

00:03:22.769 --> 00:03:25.005
Please do not misunderstand.

00:03:25.005 --> 00:03:27.541
It is true that at one time Azalie was my student.

00:03:28.075 --> 00:03:32.179
But now she is simply a beast
that brings about catastrophes.

00:03:32.179 --> 00:03:34.915
How can I possibly hesitate to dispose of such?

00:03:36.683 --> 00:03:40.420
Halt! Where are you going?
We have not finished speaking!

00:03:40.821 --> 00:03:44.891
We are currently searching for Azalie
with detection magic.

00:03:44.891 --> 00:03:47.394
Contingent on discovery,
| will depart immediately.

00:03:48.295 --> 00:03:49.429
Well, then...

00:03:55.402 --> 00:03:56.436
Master?

00:03:56.436 --> 00:03:57.738
Fear not.

00:03:58.138 --> 00:04:00.841
The subject of Azalie's disposal
has not been resolved,

00:04:01.141 --> 00:04:04.544
but we no longer have the leisure
to watch and wait.

00:04:04.544 --> 00:04:06.313
I shall rush the search.

00:04:06.713 --> 00:04:07.814
It's almost time.

00:04:08.882 --> 00:04:12.452
That man, there's something
about him I can't trust.

00:04:12.986 --> 00:04:15.489
But with his abilities and achievements,

00:04:15.489 --> 00:04:18.792
as well as he is the foremost
sorcerer of the Tower of Fangs,

00:04:18.792 --> 00:04:23.230
he is the only one we can trust
to deal with Azalie.

00:04:23.230 --> 00:04:25.098
That is not necessarily so.

00:04:26.566 --> 00:04:30.971
Though not in achievements,
he does rival him in ability.

00:04:30.971 --> 00:04:36.443
Even better, someone who's had no association
with Azalie may be better suited for this job.

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:37.978
Who is it?!

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:41.081
You're...

00:04:43.016 --> 00:04:44.417
Flameheart.

00:04:45.085 --> 00:04:47.087
| summoned him.

00:04:47.087 --> 00:04:52.592
Among the Tower of Fangs teachers,
he has ability to succeed Childman.

00:04:52.592 --> 00:04:54.094
Then this man also...

00:04:54.094 --> 00:04:58.165
Is there any reason to leave this
solely in the hands of Childman?

00:04:59.099 --> 00:05:04.604
I, Flameheart, promise to
exceed your expectations.

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:12.712
Hey, Big Brother, let's not do this after all!

00:05:12.712 --> 00:05:14.414
What are you saying, Dortin?!

00:05:14.414 --> 00:05:19.686
When you think about it, why does My Greatness
have to carry around this junky sword?

00:05:19.686 --> 00:05:21.688
It's too long. It's too heavy.
It's just in the way!

00:05:21.688 --> 00:05:24.558
But I wonder about selling it
to the Tower of Fangs.

00:05:24.825 --> 00:05:28.895
Didn't I tell you?! Even this piece of junk
is a valuable sword to a sorcerer!

00:05:28.895 --> 00:05:31.898
Well, yeah it is a relic of the Heavenly Beings,
and it does have sorcerous runes on it, so-

00:05:31.898 --> 00:05:34.901
So then, they will pay even more money
to get it in their hands!

00:05:34.901 --> 00:05:38.572
Whatever you say, the Tower of Fangs
is just a cave of sorcerers.

00:05:38.572 --> 00:05:42.609
But if we do something like that, I don't think
that sorcerer will keep quiet about it.

00:05:42.609 --> 00:05:46.112
And that sword really belongs to Miss Cleao.

00:05:47.647 --> 00:05:52.419
That tricky, slant-eyed sorcerer
and ferocious, boob-less woman?

00:05:52.419 --> 00:05:56.423
If they make a fuss, I'll throw a pillow and
kill them during a high school field trip!

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:01.127
What's wrong?

00:06:05.665 --> 00:06:09.002
Who's a tricky, slant-eyed sorcerer?

00:06:09.002 --> 00:06:13.240
Who's a ferocious, boob-less woman?

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:15.475
Tricky...

00:06:16.243 --> 00:06:17.410
Ferocious...

00:06:21.281 --> 00:06:22.849
Big Brother...

00:06:22.849 --> 00:06:28.188
Now listen to me, the Sword of Baltanders
is a precious memento from my father!

00:06:28.188 --> 00:06:31.258
If you dare try and sell it again,
you won't get off so lightly!

00:06:31.658 --> 00:06:32.959
Yes...

00:06:32.959 --> 00:06:35.195
But why are all of you here of all places?

00:06:35.195 --> 00:06:37.097
We're going to the Tower of Fangs.

00:06:37.097 --> 00:06:38.265
To the Tower of Fangs?

00:06:38.265 --> 00:06:39.132
What?

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:42.502
Hey, you, sorcerer,
take My Greatness with you!

00:06:42.502 --> 00:06:44.471
What? When you're acting so big?

00:06:44.471 --> 00:06:46.006
You want to get hurt again?

00:06:46.006 --> 00:06:47.974
Can you afford to say things like that?

00:06:47.974 --> 00:06:50.610
Aren't you guys planning to
sneak into the Tower of Fangs?

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:53.213
Well, if I tipped off the Tower of Fangs...

00:06:54.948 --> 00:06:57.183
Geez, do whatever you want!

00:07:23.643 --> 00:07:26.146
Orphen, isn't something weird?

00:07:26.146 --> 00:07:28.481
| wonder why there are so many broken places?

00:07:31.418 --> 00:07:34.020
I'm your relief.
Is there anything unusual happening?

00:07:34.354 --> 00:07:35.689
It's fine.

00:07:35.689 --> 00:07:38.658
There's no one stupid enough to try
to sneak into the Tower of Fangs.

00:07:39.859 --> 00:07:43.530
That's true, but I wonder why
Azalie attacked the Tower?

00:07:44.464 --> 00:07:47.434
So that's it. Miss Azalie did this.

00:07:48.201 --> 00:07:49.803
Then I'll leave it to you.

00:07:49.803 --> 00:07:51.171
Thanks.

00:08:01.514 --> 00:08:04.384
We got in really easy, didn't we?

00:08:04.384 --> 00:08:06.152
And the sentries outside aren't here.

00:08:06.152 --> 00:08:10.724
Because the rampart was destroyed,
the Tower of Fangs' shield tore.

00:08:10.724 --> 00:08:13.426
Normally, you can't get in even with magic.

00:08:14.227 --> 00:08:15.295
So that's it.

00:08:15.695 --> 00:08:18.698
The problems start from here. How should...

00:08:20.066 --> 00:08:21.468
When did he?!

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:25.638
Where did you come in from?

00:08:27.874 --> 00:08:29.676
D-Deep Dragon!

00:08:31.378 --> 00:08:32.312
We're in!

00:08:37.617 --> 00:08:38.618
What?

00:09:02.142 --> 00:09:04.144
We're here! This is the archives.

00:09:08.348 --> 00:09:10.050
Wow!

00:09:10.050 --> 00:09:14.721
These are all Books of Shadows?!

00:09:16.022 --> 00:09:19.959
Yeah, there will be a clue to saving Azalie here.

00:09:20.493 --> 00:09:21.961
There will be...

00:09:21.961 --> 00:09:24.064
Okay, let's start searching!

00:09:41.681 --> 00:09:42.582
Did it!

00:09:42.949 --> 00:09:44.617
What are you doing?!

00:09:44.617 --> 00:09:49.155
Well, it's just... I don't really understand
what's written in them anyway.

00:09:49.155 --> 00:09:53.960
| really, really want to help, but...

00:09:55.361 --> 00:09:57.497
Anyway, I have no choice but to look.

00:09:58.198 --> 00:09:59.399
Orphen...

00:10:00.767 --> 00:10:02.669
What about those two?

00:10:03.803 --> 00:10:06.306
They said they were going to explore.
They went through there.

00:10:18.084 --> 00:10:21.087
Amazing! It's amazing!

00:10:21.554 --> 00:10:23.790
It's the wind! I feel the wind!

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:28.895
The wind of ages is blowing toward
Volcan Polkano of Mazmaturia!

00:10:28.895 --> 00:10:31.231
Big Brother, I understand how you feel,

00:10:31.231 --> 00:10:35.235
but if you steal these, you make
the Tower of Fangs your enemy!

00:10:35.969 --> 00:10:39.506
Just that one sorcerer
has given us enough problems.

00:10:39.506 --> 00:10:43.543
This time there could be ten times
as many trying to take our lives!

00:10:43.543 --> 00:10:45.645
B-but there's this much!

00:10:45.645 --> 00:10:48.982
They won't notice if just this
one thing is missing.

00:10:49.249 --> 00:10:51.284
I'm certain they'll find out.

00:11:00.460 --> 00:11:01.594
That is...

00:11:21.147 --> 00:11:22.982
So my room...

00:11:25.018 --> 00:11:26.519
is still here.

00:12:22.742 --> 00:12:24.744
Hey, just where are you looking?

00:12:25.144 --> 00:12:26.946
You're wrong, Azalie!

00:12:26.946 --> 00:12:28.815
| was looking at your pendant.

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:31.884
Isn't it nice?

00:12:33.553 --> 00:12:38.091
I'm sure that by this time tomorrow,
you'll have one hanging on your chest too.

00:12:38.458 --> 00:12:40.727
Isn't that why you've been studying all this time?

00:12:41.761 --> 00:12:45.064
But I don't have any confidence
in passing the exam to the next level.

00:12:45.064 --> 00:12:45.999
Ouch!

00:12:45.999 --> 00:12:47.233
What are you doing?

00:12:47.233 --> 00:12:50.236
What do you mean, "don't have any confidence"?
No confidence?

00:12:50.236 --> 00:12:52.972
When I've been tutoring your studies everyday?

00:12:52.972 --> 00:12:55.875
Were you studying just to fail your exams?

00:12:56.409 --> 00:12:58.478
That's not it, but...

00:12:58.478 --> 00:13:04.183
When I'm lending you my notes,
and even making up mock exams?

00:13:05.551 --> 00:13:08.187
What was all that effort for anyway?

00:13:08.521 --> 00:13:12.725
I'll pass! I'll show you! I will pass!
For your sake too, Azalie!

00:13:13.059 --> 00:13:14.160
Really?

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:15.962
Yeah! I promise!

00:13:15.962 --> 00:13:19.632
So, could you help me study?

00:13:20.266 --> 00:13:22.568
Okay then, problem five's next.

00:13:26.039 --> 00:13:28.041
Azalie! Azalie!

00:13:35.515 --> 00:13:37.417
You did it, didn't you, Krylancelo!

00:13:37.417 --> 00:13:42.422
Of course! I've got the best tutor
in the Tower of Fangs behind me!

00:13:43.122 --> 00:13:45.358
I'm so glad! Really!

00:13:48.227 --> 00:13:50.396
Congratulations, Krylancelo.

00:14:14.387 --> 00:14:15.988
| can't do this anymore!

00:14:15.988 --> 00:14:17.056
Cleao?

00:14:17.056 --> 00:14:19.258
| understand how Orphen feels,

00:14:19.258 --> 00:14:21.994
but to tell us to find a clue
in one night in all of this!

00:14:21.994 --> 00:14:23.296
It's definitely impossible!

00:14:23.296 --> 00:14:24.897
That's true, but...

00:14:31.971 --> 00:14:34.073
This! Could it be?

00:14:55.428 --> 00:14:57.196
Just a little more...

00:15:13.813 --> 00:15:15.014
I'm saved!

00:15:16.749 --> 00:15:19.519
Hey, what did you do!

00:15:19.519 --> 00:15:20.787
Sorry!

00:15:20.953 --> 00:15:22.155
What was that sound?

00:15:22.155 --> 00:15:23.489
It came from inside the archives!

00:15:25.458 --> 00:15:27.493
Damn! Let's go!

00:15:29.162 --> 00:15:30.363
Hey!

00:15:30.663 --> 00:15:32.365
Please wait, Master!

00:15:37.403 --> 00:15:38.738
What's up, sorcerer?

00:15:38.738 --> 00:15:40.673
If you don't want to get caught,
come with us!

00:15:40.673 --> 00:15:42.542
What did you say? Wait!

00:15:49.248 --> 00:15:51.517
What?! What in the world?

00:15:55.221 --> 00:15:57.757
That man... It couldn't be?

00:16:05.131 --> 00:16:08.501
Master, Krylancelo has arrived.

00:16:08.501 --> 00:16:09.969
What shall you do?

00:16:12.472 --> 00:16:15.374
But even so, I'm such a lucky guy!

00:16:15.374 --> 00:16:18.511
That bothersome Azalie became a monster,

00:16:18.511 --> 00:16:21.013
and Krylancelo's anathema.

00:16:21.214 --> 00:16:26.719
Because of those two,
Childman's close to losing his standing.

00:16:27.253 --> 00:16:30.356
Now there is no one left to threaten me.

00:16:30.656 --> 00:16:33.593
All that's left is for me to dispose of Azalie.

00:16:38.531 --> 00:16:41.501
I'll rise straight to the top of the Tower of Fangs!

00:16:41.501 --> 00:16:44.437
And then I'll let the whole continent know

00:16:44.437 --> 00:16:48.407
that I, Flameheart, am the ultimate sorcerer!

00:16:50.376 --> 00:16:52.712
Master, they've all arrived.

00:16:57.149 --> 00:17:00.152
Okay, strengthen the outer wall of the Tower.

00:17:00.152 --> 00:17:01.954
Don't let one ant escape!

00:17:01.954 --> 00:17:02.922
Yes!

00:17:04.023 --> 00:17:06.626
I'm such a lucky man!

00:17:06.626 --> 00:17:11.764
Krylancelo, I'll dispose of you
and then rise up even higher.

00:17:14.634 --> 00:17:16.736
We just pass that,
and then we're outside, right?

00:17:22.475 --> 00:17:24.477
Well, let's go, Master!

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:31.784
Wait!

00:17:31.784 --> 00:17:32.952
Come this way.

00:17:32.952 --> 00:17:35.288
Wait, Orphen, where do you
think you're going?

00:17:35.288 --> 00:17:37.189
As soon as we pass this,
we're outside, you know?!

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:41.327
Let's go, Cleao. I'm sure Master
has some kind of plan!

00:17:41.727 --> 00:17:42.828
Wait a minute!

00:17:52.138 --> 00:17:54.774
Sealing magic? Well, then!

00:17:56.342 --> 00:17:58.778
Armour of Ice, that doth spin around me!

00:18:06.953 --> 00:18:08.054
| see.

00:18:09.822 --> 00:18:12.124
So, you're the commanding officer?

00:18:13.759 --> 00:18:14.994
Orphen...

00:18:16.295 --> 00:18:17.463
Get back.

00:18:18.230 --> 00:18:20.866
Don't do anything stupid, Krylancelo.

00:18:20.866 --> 00:18:23.235
Krylancelo? I don't know him.

00:18:23.235 --> 00:18:25.471
Though if you want the monstrous
hand man, he's right over there.

00:18:27.640 --> 00:18:29.008
Don't fool with me!

00:18:29.008 --> 00:18:30.676
What do you mean by this?

00:18:30.676 --> 00:18:34.714
Are you planning to destroy the Tower of Fangs
by using offensive spells in rapid succession?

00:18:35.281 --> 00:18:37.049
And what would you do, if I were?

00:18:37.049 --> 00:18:40.086
After all, I'm the man who
abandoned the Tower of Fangs!

00:18:40.453 --> 00:18:41.954
As if I'd let you!

00:18:42.355 --> 00:18:43.422
O Fire!

00:18:43.723 --> 00:18:47.159
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:18:50.596 --> 00:18:53.232
If you can become an officer of the guard
with that kind of power,

00:18:53.232 --> 00:18:58.204
the skill of the sorcerers at the Tower of Fangs
has fallen in the last five years.

00:18:58.537 --> 00:18:59.772
What?

00:19:00.139 --> 00:19:03.643
If you're going to attack, then attack, or else...

00:19:03.643 --> 00:19:04.744
you'll die.

00:19:08.814 --> 00:19:09.815
O Light!

00:19:12.918 --> 00:19:14.920
Towers of Heaven, that dance around me!

00:19:26.866 --> 00:19:28.167
You did it, Brother!

00:19:28.167 --> 00:19:29.001
We're going!

00:19:29.368 --> 00:19:30.936
What did I do?!

00:19:30.936 --> 00:19:32.538
Wait! Hey, sorcerer!

00:19:33.272 --> 00:19:35.408
Master, this is...

00:19:35.408 --> 00:19:37.076
A relic of the Heavenly Beings.

00:19:37.076 --> 00:19:39.912
A device to take you somewhere else instantly.

00:19:40.579 --> 00:19:43.549
By now, there should be sorcerers
surrounding the Tower,

00:19:43.549 --> 00:19:45.451
but if we use this guy...

00:19:46.218 --> 00:19:48.487
It seems you've matured a little.

00:19:50.322 --> 00:19:51.557
Childman!

00:19:52.558 --> 00:19:55.494
So you see everything, do you?

00:19:55.494 --> 00:19:59.398
| would rather you not associate me
with the idiots outside.

00:19:59.799 --> 00:20:03.636
I warn you. Do not hinder me, Krylancelo.

00:20:04.070 --> 00:20:07.540
Should you prove a hindrance again,
I shall kill you.

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:09.241
| thought I told you.

00:20:09.241 --> 00:20:11.777
I'll save Azalie, without fail!

00:20:12.611 --> 00:20:16.048
If you get in my way, I won't forgive even you!

00:20:16.048 --> 00:20:17.083
Understand?!

00:20:35.234 --> 00:20:36.635
Is he here yet?

00:20:45.711 --> 00:20:48.214
We did it! We got out!

00:20:48.848 --> 00:20:52.051
Oh, no! This is a graveyard, isn't it?

00:20:53.652 --> 00:20:54.854
Master?

00:20:56.355 --> 00:20:57.723
Azalie...

00:20:58.524 --> 00:21:00.860
Azalie? It couldn't be?!

00:21:23.783 --> 00:21:28.053
From today on I will be known as Orphen!

00:21:33.959 --> 00:21:35.127
Orphen...

00:21:39.832 --> 00:21:40.933
This is...

00:21:40.933 --> 00:21:44.937
We found it, a clue to turning
Azalie back to normal!

00:21:44.937 --> 00:21:46.138
Really?

00:21:46.138 --> 00:21:50.810
According to this book, there's a secret
to the Sword of Baltanders.

00:21:51.143 --> 00:21:53.012
How about it, Master?

00:21:53.012 --> 00:21:55.614
Why don't we go see the person
who wrote this book?

00:21:55.614 --> 00:21:58.751
It seems they're the one who discovered
the Ruins of Baltanders.

00:21:59.251 --> 00:22:01.520
Rocks Row?

00:22:02.421 --> 00:22:04.356
Rocks Row...

00:22:13.899 --> 00:22:18.470
Ten years ago, Childman saved
this town, Sanmeikouzan.

00:22:18.838 --> 00:22:22.975
So the people of this town welcome sorcerers.

00:22:23.342 --> 00:22:26.345
What? The same accident that
happened then, has happened again?!

00:22:26.979 --> 00:22:28.380
I'll do it then!

00:22:28.380 --> 00:22:31.317
If Childman can do it, then so can I!

00:22:31.684 --> 00:22:33.719
Next time on Sorcerous Stabber Orphen:

00:22:33.719 --> 00:22:35.588
MEMORY YOU can't SURPASS
"Memory You Can't Surpass.”

00:22:35.588 --> 00:22:37.790
MEMORY YOU can't SURPASS
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:22:37.790 --> 00:22:38.791
MEMORY YOU CAN'T SURPASS

00:22:49.268 --> 00:22:53.339
You aren't here, the one I really love

00:22:53.339 --> 00:22:57.409
My first love has reached a dead end

00:22:57.877 --> 00:23:06.118
Tonight in my dreams, a smiling you doesn't appear

00:23:06.752 --> 00:23:10.789
Your last lines came out of your lips too soon

00:23:10.789 --> 00:23:14.393
You were troubled by

00:23:15.327 --> 00:23:19.265
Your last lines as soon as your lips said them

00:23:19.265 --> 00:23:23.002
But then you kissed me

00:23:24.069 --> 00:23:28.474
To only my lips

00:23:28.474 --> 00:23:32.678
Please give your warmth

00:23:32.678 --> 00:23:37.049
To only my lips

00:23:37.049 --> 00:23:40.920
Will you always remain

00:23:41.186 --> 00:23:43.656
A gentle you

00:23:43.656 --> 00:23:47.826
To only my lips

00:23:47.826 --> 00:23:52.131
No matter how hard I try to forget

00:23:52.131 --> 00:23:56.402
To only my lips

00:23:56.402 --> 00:24:02.608
Will you always remain

00:24:02.942 --> 00:24:07.546
The last of you
